  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Analyze the components of "Rhyme Scheme and Lineation" as outlined in Section II. Explain why each sub-question is crucial for a thorough structural analysis of a poem.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Explain the importance of identifying the "Speaker" in a poem, as prompted by Section II. How does understanding the speaker contribute to a deeper appreciation of the text?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Discuss the concepts of "Tone and Mood" in poetry, referencing the options provided in the text. How do these elements shape a reader's experience and interpretation of a poem?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Imagine you are a student completing this exercise. Describe the process you would follow to "rectify the false statements" in Section I, assuming you have read the poem "Kaveri".$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Critically evaluate the scope of literary analysis covered in Section II. Are there any other significant poetic elements that could have been included, and why might they be important?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Explain how the questions about "Rhyme Scheme and Lineation" (Section II, Part 1) guide a student towards understanding the aesthetic and structural choices made by the poet.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Discuss the pedagogical value of providing a list of options for "Tone and Mood" rather than asking students to generate terms independently. What are the advantages and disadvantages of this approach?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Based on the types of questions asked in both Section I and Section II, infer the likely educational objectives of this specific "Check Your Understanding" page for students studying the poem "Kaveri".$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('10d80b5c-e568-43b6-8a0b-6c818b0269dc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Ever since Sentila became old enough to accompany her mother to the fields and forests, she began to dream of becoming a pot maker like her mother and grandmother. However Arenla, her mother, wanted her to become a weaver.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1c782237-b51b-43b2-9607-30dc4915c25e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$On days when she managed to stay at home while her parents went to the fields, Sentila approached expert potters to learn the skill. They were at first amused by the little girl’s insistence as they thought that she would soon outgrow her childish passion for the craft.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fe737dd2-dcff-49c3-aa5f-faa8607dc7e1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila did not disclose her fascination with pot making at home as she had overheard a conversation between her parents one night. Her mother was complaining about Sentila’s indifference to weaving.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c3e37681-a0b9-4767-b5d1-dd3c1d4e7322', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$She said, “I shall not teach her pot making as it has brought no joy to me and only a pittance for my troubles. The riverbank, where the grey and red clay required for making pots is found, is sixteen kilometres from here.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a639495c-8188-42c7-99fc-8748bf34f92c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I need to climb down a sheer drop to the riverbank and my back aches from carrying the heavy load uphill all the way to the village. Pounding the stubborn clay inside bamboo cylinders to soften it, is also tedious.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5b2b7c30-26ac-4fe9-9b20-8bd271fc5bd7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$So many times, I’ve dropped the mould out of sheer exhaustion and have had to start all over again. It takes months to bring out a batch of pots after so much labour. And the reward? A few rupees.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('de118b3a-7b7a-4ab6-94aa-431c9d7c0b41', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$But if Sentila learns weaving, she can make much more money besides providing enough cloth for the family. Weaving is outgrow: to lose interest in something as one grows older indifference: lack of interest in something pittance: a small amount of money received as income pounding: repeated beating tedious: tiring$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1d5598bc-041a-4e50-b300-2aed72263853', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Ever since Sentila became old enough to accompany her mother to the fields and forests, she began to dream of becoming a pot maker like her mother and grandmother. However Arenla, her mother, wanted her to become a weaver.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a52f47f5-0c73-4426-b4bf-bb3798fa0e72', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The riverbank, where the grey and red clay required for making pots is found, is sixteen kilometres from here. I need to climb down a sheer drop to the riverbank and my back aches from carrying the heavy load uphill all the way to the village.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('52a3465e-a0ab-4682-b897-fc1f96643aef', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Pounding the stubborn clay inside bamboo cylinders to soften it, is also tedious. So many times, I’ve dropped the mould out of sheer exhaustion and have had to start all over again. It takes months to bring out a batch of pots after so much labour. And the reward? A few rupees.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a0bcdfc6-defc-4eb2-a35d-170d0f4f7e79', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Pot Maker not messy like pot making and can be done indoors in all seasons. Also, the time spent on weaving one shawl is much less and the return is handsome.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1b294cae-0aa1-4645-9ad6-c1e1b4211c7a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila continued her visits to watch the potters at work. She saw how the clay was mixed with water and pounded, how careful they were when they pushed their left hand into a lump of the softened clay and how deftly they rotated the lump as they started giving shape to the rotating clay with a spatula held in the right hand.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b2da6f25-a71c-4359-b664-b3476d974dc3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The regular tap, tap of the spatula on the clay was music to her ears as she watched in fascination the pot emerging out of a shapeless lump right in front of her eyes.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4acf887c-42ce-4b1c-a2b3-a57bc57d0492', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$After two or three days, the pots would be given a final touch up to retain the required shape and to test the consistency. Only then would the pots be taken out to dry in the sun before being loaded deftly: skillfully spatula: tool used by a potter to shape a pot$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('10f31d54-242f-4e75-9ae9-cda9e33c2043', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila continued her visits to watch the potters at work. She saw how the clay was mixed with water and pounded, how careful they were when they pushed their left hand into a lump of the softened clay and how deftly they rotated the lump as they started giving shape to the rotating clay with a spatula held in the right hand.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c5a6e013-3081-41ff-bdcd-7c3612b946d8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Pot Maker not messy like pot making and can be done indoors in all seasons. Also, the time spent on weaving one shawl is much less and the return is handsome.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8cbfbe44-2d7f-4358-a570-b8a26724ffd9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$She saw how the clay was mixed with water and pounded, how careful they were when they pushed their left hand into a lump of the softened clay and how deftly they rotated the lump as they started giving shape to the rotating clay with a spatula held in the right hand.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fcf24ea2-c3ae-4e37-93af-34f5ced00d9b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The regular tap, tap of the spatula on the clay was music to her ears as she watched in fascination the pot emerging out of a shapeless lump right in front of her eyes. After two or three days, the pots would be given a final touch up to retain the required shape and to test the consistency.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('6fc4c3a9-4f64-4f67-9569-5e07162476da', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Only then would the pots be taken out to dry in the sun before being loaded deftly: skillfully spatula: tool used by a potter to shape a pot$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('32b3153b-13ca-44f9-ba14-5dea5d0f389e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila continued her visits to watch the potters at work. She saw how the clay was mixed with water and pounded, how careful they were when they pushed their left hand into a lump of the softened clay and how deftly they rotated the lump as they started giving shape to the rotating clay with a spatula held in the right hand. The regular tap, tap of the spatula on the clay was music to her ears as she watched in fascination the pot emerging out of a shapeless lump right in front of her eyes.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('487ca366-42bf-469f-bb84-36ce966e9090', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kaveri on to a kiln in a uniform pattern on a bed of hay and dried bamboo and covered with another layer of the same materials, and then the kiln would be fired. One had to tend the fire carefully as over firing or under firing would ruin the entire batch.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3d6ce744-5fa3-4401-bb32-7d83a0e93c47', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Arenla heard of her daughter’s visits but pretended to be ignorant of them. By late afternoon, Sentila had to return home quickly, so that when her mother came back from the fields, she would be there.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8adcd379-964b-46a4-b9aa-43c866523543', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Gradually, Sentila’s visits became a topic of village gossip. People wondered why Arenla was refusing to teach the skill to her daughter. They were worried that if all pot makers followed suit, then there would be no expert potters to take their place.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('129ba1e9-bf3f-40ee-a11a-a9ca552f42c0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$One day, Sentila’s father, Mesoba was summoned by the village council and asked to explain why Arenla was refusing to pass on the skill to her daughter.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('efee0a90-d0cd-42b7-a782-a07e90adc335', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$He replied in a humble tone, “Uncles and elder brothers, Arenla has never said that she will not teach our daughter pot making; it is only that we wanted her to grow stronger after her illness. You will soon see Sentila making the best pots in the village.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('89544732-9586-4ffc-b6c5-67e32142674c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$After listening to Mesoba’s explanation, the elders decided to let him go, cautioning him to remind Arenla that it was her duty to teach her daughter the skill that was handed down from generation to generation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5457e22e-6c88-4630-bb5f-f3d5044d725d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$They also told him that skills such as pot making, which not only catered to the needs of the people but also symbolised the tradition and history of the people, did not ‘belong’ to any individual.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8f7fa6e2-29be-4a20-89ac-701b3ddea81e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$And experts were obliged to pass on their skills not only to their own children but also to anyone who wished to learn.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b4b9a3ea-5091-4169-8b5c-b659ef1b715d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Mesoba went home and discussed the matter with Arenla.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7c7dc62d-1835-451b-ac46-a44b72996852', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$One had to tend the fire carefully as over firing or under firing would ruin the entire batch. Arenla heard of her daughter’s visits but pretended to be ignorant of them. By late afternoon, Sentila had to return home quickly, so that when her mother came back from the fields, she would be there. Gradually, Sentila’s visits became a topic of village gossip.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('37b866d4-d846-4a7e-a0f2-d0b8c4ed9f5a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The following year, Arenla took Sentila to the riverbank where the grey and red clay was found.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f8625dd9-8db5-412b-96d8-54684a3fdd1b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$She taught Sentila how to dig the clay with a dao.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a8ab5ca7-0c13-4f25-b72b-521e9be56509', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$load it on to her carrying basket and soak it in the trough in the work shed.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c79a3ecb-d917-4ff5-bd3d-0ba6d315a399', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$before stuffing it into the bamboo cylinder in the right proportion to pound it.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1297a74f-f092-411b-8860-a10990d517ed', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila was a quick learner and turned the clay into malleable dough.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f1ff960e-61a6-48e5-aa61-e88fd5c0f527', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$But when she tried her hand at the shaping of the lump into a pot,$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('54251bd4-6100-4e61-82f3-8f3f701d9bcb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$dao: an instrument used to dig$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('d8c758c4-113a-474d-8cdf-96c019c16e95', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$malleable: able to be put into shape without breaking or cracking$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('93dba307-f2d8-4d97-aaa2-3cc32a26aded', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The following year, Arenla took Sentila to the riverbank where the grey and red clay was found. She taught Sentila how to dig the clay with a dao, load it on to her carrying basket.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a49de7e1-fc67-43ed-b860-1c68b227e083', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila was a quick learner and turned the clay into malleable dough. But when she tried her hand at the shaping of the lump into a pot,$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0c837895-79ac-4391-89c2-8fa07203647b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$she could not even hold the lump of dough properly.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f84fedf7-1c94-4b13-ac12-3c8e26738eae', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The mother simply sat in a corner and watched the girl try again and again.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('6270ed97-8238-442f-b7e3-5fa59aeda906', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$While Sentila hung her head in shame and frustration, Arenla took over the job, and transformed the lump into a beautiful pot.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('502ef7b0-a464-4f38-9178-febee2b26c8d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$These sessions continued for almost a year but Sentila was unable to learn anything from her mother.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b4b0c00b-cd6d-4e13-8472-46db9dbea75f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The next year, when Sentila matured, according to custom, she was sent to stay for some nights in one of the girls’ dormitories$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f26f00d7-a80b-4d94-8812-71537a0ca369', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$supervised by a kind, middle-aged widow whom the girls called ‘Onula’ or Aunty.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f5cdb490-2480-403b-b835-43956f87808c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$She had heard of the discord in Sentila’s family$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('47e94530-943f-4c47-8a60-3264d09dbd0c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$and resolved to help the girl in every possible way.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('82380dbd-125d-4a34-934f-2075eeaceb84', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$One evening, when everyone except Sentila went to attend a musical evening, Onula saw her taking out some clay and the implements from her basket quietly.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('42c44491-8b02-4cbd-91f1-42c184cc3d23', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$dormitories: large rooms containing many beds as in a hostel resolved: (here) determined$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('50b12a60-a532-43e9-b692-2774a411f140', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Pot Maker clumsy efforts to make a pot and noticed that Sentila was too tense. As a result, the clay seemed unable or unwilling to yield the right shape.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fc816a18-65ee-49ff-8f2c-5a50724e7bb5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When Sentila wearily let the misshapen lump fall flat on the ground, Onula went to her and said, “Don’t worry, little one, I shall teach you how to make a perfect pot.” Sentila watched in amazement as Onula fashioned a beautiful pot and asked her to try again.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('801d1741-8a40-46ab-817e-ea61a590b8b7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila took another lump of clay and with a confidence she had never felt before, started the process all over again following the instructions she had just received. She created a beautiful pot!$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b9cd1f10-73a7-427b-88f4-f3c80381cc72', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When it was done, she sat there admiring her work but Onula said, “The mouth of the pot is all wrong.” Sentila looked at Onula in frustration who smiled and said, “When you work with your mother next time, watch her carefully when she is shaping the mouth of the pot. You are a quick learner and you will do well.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0e9ae037-5e01-42b4-8b68-9f399c364a44', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$During the next pot making session, Sentila observed how her mother held the left hand and the spatula, how she slackened the rhythm when fashioning the mouth of the pots and how a strip of elongated dough was added to the mouth to make the rim.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fcd895aa-ba11-48ff-a2fa-add953c8991f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Then, on a bright sunny day, Arenla told Sentila that they should try to make as many pots as they could, otherwise they would not have enough days of sunshine to dry them. They went to the shed quite early to begin.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('704b69e6-b65f-453e-9ba4-fde5fc53cdde', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$As usual, Arenla completed a batch quickly and asked Sentila to take over. Complaining that she had a headache and a backache, she went out telling Sentila to try and make as many pots as she could.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('914bc995-46b7-461a-83a3-8cb2c41ba4c5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sentila was surprised and reluctantly began to beat the dough in perfect coordination with her left hand.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('14cf6bfd-dde9-4e19-8031-09bc4a8e61b5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$wearily: tiredly$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0f607ec6-9a37-4896-9fab-27df3cdc42e2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$slackened: relaxed$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c43a3d5c-0973-47ed-bec5-d136cf67f467', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Before long, she realised that the pot was ready. She started on the next one, and like a sprinter who had suddenly found momentum, she continued making pot after pot with the same speed and dexterity that she had noticed in her mother’s hands. Finally, when she looked at her row of pots, she saw that she had made just one short of her mother’s tally.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('2f433c16-6731-4516-a27e-46db2314d222', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Exhausted from the labour, she decided to go into the house and join her mother for lunch. When she reached the threshold, she found her mother lying on the floor. She was not breathing. Sentila ran towards the common area in the village for help.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('615f9613-6547-409c-bd68-145db7f82276', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The villagers raced to the house, and sent for Mesoba. When Arenla’s body was being carried out of the house the next morning, Sentila ran after it, shouting, “Mother, I did not wish it to happen this way; it simply came to me. Please forgive me.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bd1c7891-0247-4c86-b8d3-6afe11380f72', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Those who heard her, did not understand what she meant, except for Onula. She intuitively sensed that something momentous had happened. On her way back, Onula noticed that the door to the work shed was slightly ajar.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7eb49ffd-4e4b-4125-b308-315de12351ea', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Out of curiosity, she stepped inside and abruptly stopped in her tracks; two neat rows of newly-made pots stood side by side. She could find nothing to tell one batch from the other. She was sure that it was not the handiwork of one person alone.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c6b4cc40-dabb-4b53-9766-a12b09bda7bd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Onula stood there for a long time as if trying to absorb a new phenomenon. Slowly she walked away from this place of wonder, as she considered it to be, because she believed that she momentum: driving force dexterity: skill tally: a count of (pots)$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a45dd0cb-ce9e-4024-9d28-de0ce1ec0206', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$She started on the next one, and like a sprinter who had suddenly found momentum, she continued making pot after pot with the same speed and dexterity that she had noticed in her mother’s hands.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('83777932-76a4-496e-9a23-61011a3f947a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Finally, when she looked at her row of pots, she saw that she had made just one short of her mother’s tally. Exhausted from the labour, she decided to go into the house and join her mother for lunch.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('84f73447-1e9b-4f88-81b7-94d6fafd8816', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When she reached the threshold, she found her mother lying on the floor. She was not breathing. Sentila ran towards the common area in the village for help. The villagers raced to the house, and sent for Mesoba.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b43fbda8-388a-41cb-b796-cdf8cd8030da', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Those who heard her, did not understand what she meant, except for Onula. She intuitively sensed that something momentous had happened. On her way back, Onula noticed that the door to the work shed was slightly ajar. Out of curiosity, she stepped inside and abruptly stopped in her tracks; two neat rows of newly-made pots stood side by side.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
