  ('15eefcd6-f7cc-4d0a-9b7a-62c667c5c7fa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The boatmen gathering their nets from the shore, sailing, and singing while at work, return to tell the tales of life at sea,$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8ddf1976-1cb1-4988-b8de-3b4f26cf3e08', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The shoemakers affirming the quality of their work, for the feet that walk, dance, run, jump, return home.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('d40490ef-77fa-470f-b4a1-6e9a16be6d31', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The delicious singing of the cook, or the rhythm of designer, mason, each celebrating what belongs to them and to none else,$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('25752287-b96f-4daf-bdf5-ac414072d108', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The voice of their vocation is the voice of their identity. I hear Bharat celebrating, the varied voices I hear!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-14T11-05-42-601Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('e4a28d8b-ff3c-42f8-b0e9-fb0ae8011b6e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'cb2a7c44-b28f-440b-b6d4-047f1fe26154', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Gifts of Grace: Honouring Our Vocations
The boatmen gathering their nets from the shore, sailing, and singing while at work, return to tell the tales of life at sea,
The shoemakers affirming the quality of their work, for the feet that walk, dance, run, jump, return home.
The delicious singing of the cook, or the rhythm of designer, mason, each celebrating what belongs to them and to none else,
The voice of their vocation is the voice of their identity. I hear Bharat celebrating, the varied voices I hear!
